<!-- kickstart-tooling -->
## Development workflow

- Read the affected code and run focused tests for each changed behavior.
- Run `mix check`, `mix ci`, and `mix security`;
  report actual results and checks not run.
- Fix findings rather than weakening gates or adding blanket exclusions.
  Preserve the ExSlop plugin when changing `.credo.exs`.
<%= if phoenix? do %>
- For UI or runtime changes, verify the running Phoenix application and affected
  browser/LiveView flows; static checks alone do not establish runtime behavior.
<% end %>
